Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move through Earth's horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find infinity for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fight for this blue sea and\Nlet the wind take us far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can come back to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can be present right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw away this drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we share.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be so afraid to podcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To have a friend right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will always be here by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.72,0:00:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the darkest of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look and breathe it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the ones who\Nare meant to move them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move to our single horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find insanity for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a world from our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We will win for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming. On.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight however we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to be the best we will run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To the top, to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta be the ones that\Njust keep dreaming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never stop. Cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta give everything I got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Become the greatest of all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find infinite portions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We will step up and we\Nwill leave for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So keep moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wounded bad, but\Nhe won't give up Shusui.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he making me work?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.22,0:02:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for me, he should be easy to track.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my damn sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this place his house? What a dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that your samurai associate\Ncan deal with that monk fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I wonder who he is,\Nother than a weapon thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just so glad that you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rest can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've rendered me speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful that you care so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Step back, Lady Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it, Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he wants every\Nlast sword in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.86,0:03:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, see that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They got racks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fill that green guy with lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kappa style?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yorikiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamacho!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about me, Lady Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I fear more\Nenemies may be on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to walk in the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke, Kawamatsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen an adult pout and\Npuff out their cheeks like a blowfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It brings back memories, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I never dared to dream that we'd\Nbe walking side by side again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much I want\Nto talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a long and mundane tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But the first time I visited\Nwas shortly after you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this was many years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,both Ringo and nearby Hakumai\Nwere held by the Shimotsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As you might recall, they were a\Nclan famed for their hardiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The daimyo's name was\NLord Shimotsuki Ushimaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He was well known as a master swordsman\Nand always shared his company with a fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A fox?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, like every other region,\NRingo was lost to Kaido and his forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, have you heard of the eternal\Ngraves erected here as a local tradition?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Corpses are placed in caskets,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and they don't decompose for\Ncenturies due to the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And their locations are marked by\Nswords stabbed into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,People in Ringo are given\Na blade when they are born.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They will grow up with them and\Nkeep them into old age as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When they die, the swords they\Ncarried serve as their grave markers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For all time, they're\Ninseparable from their swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, of course, that is why\Nthey're called Eternal Graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, since some of these\Nweapons here are famed blades,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,grave robbing is quite often an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is simply a fact of life in Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.72,0:05:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to tell you what\Ntranspired here 13 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Having lost you, I prepared to\Nslice open my belly in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about the swords! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be some samurai curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,At least let me die in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If my memory serves me,\Nit was several years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be Onimaru, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the Komofox that stood before me was the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,loyal companion of Lord\NShimotsuki Ushimaru,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the late daimyo of Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, these graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been protecting them on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,More than five years had passed\Nsince the downfall of Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And all that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru alone had been\Nprotecting the eternal
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,graves from thieves who\Nwould take their swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.57,0:07:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to fear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You are injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're finally awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been told that\Nfox is like fried tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You must eat, or your\Nwound will never heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then how will you\Nprotect your master's grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stubborn. Just take a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka-ba-ba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a spot of indigestion, not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The food was so good I ate a bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka-ba-ba-ba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind my belly's rumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I do insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We need not fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.73,0:09:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Release me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't expect you to\Nunderstand why I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.74,0:09:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me when I tell you I do not\Nwant to disturb the peace of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But right now, I must,\Nor this land will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The fight for this country isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In 13 years, there will\Nbe another great battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The day will come when the\Nsamurai of this nation rise
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, standing proud in the\Nface of our adversaries. But
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,their efforts will not bear\Nfruit without swords A great
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,many of them On the field of\Nbattle When your comrade falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.78,0:10:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you take up their blade And carry\Non The souls that reside in those
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,blades will empower the samurai\Nas they strike down their foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:11:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Until that day is won, this\Nland is still a battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Onimaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle between the\Nbeast pirates and the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,people of the land of\NWano is not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It is still too early to\Nlay these swords to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,In preparation for the\Nreturn of the samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we must guard these swords and ensure that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the grave robbers don't take a single one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I'll collect every\Nblade myself, and hide them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand now. I've failed at my duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've been given a second chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the role I must fulfill!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.92,0:11:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:12:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When I fail to protect Lady Hyori,\NI plan to end my life in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't die yet, not\Nwhen there's work to be done,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.44,0:12:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,not when I can be of use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have so much remorse;\Nif I don't keep busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it will consume me, if\Nyou refuse to let go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bite off my damned arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it and eat it for all I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will not give up until I'm through!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've had a change of heart already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you understood my words?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru and I joined forces\Nto protect the graves
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,of the samurai and hide\Ntheir swords away for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, another day of robbing graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather frigid this morning, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If it carries on like this, soon we\Nwon't have any place left to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we could dig a bit\Nof a cavern to hide them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm famished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I sell a sword or two in\Nthe capital, I could eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine working on a full stomach and\Nnot worrying about food every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All in chest. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, an army marches on its stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back, Onimaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:15:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought some food for\Nthe two of us to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fried tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed to see how we're\Ngoing to make money out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo, are you sure this\Nplan's going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did my research on\Nthese so-called eternal graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a treasure Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We can steal as many weapons as we like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cross that bridge, and we'll\Nreach a massive grave site.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka-pa-pa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka-pa-pa-pa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Begone, you robbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall not seize a single\Nblade from the soul of Ringo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of nonsense! Bongo! Bongo! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Monimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:15:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.18,0:16:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.61,0:16:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am known as the Guardian\Nof Bandit's Bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You, dear, mad love!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, leave your weapons and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Or face my wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki Moria, that can't be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Same name, doing the same job?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,To finish up the story,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to the capital a short time\Nlater in order to acquire some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But after that, I was not able to return\Nto Ringo due to certain circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,CITIZENS OF THE CAPITAL,\NPLEASE FORGIVE ME!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,YOU'RE UNDER ARREST OF AN OPEN EDGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,WE FINALLY CAUGHT YOU,\NBelt FRIED Davy THIEVE!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,NOW STOP RESISTING!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M A FULL, THIS IS THE\NGRAVEST BLUNDER OF MY LIFE!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Onimaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And you were held captive for 13 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I let everyone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, you're here because\Nyou wanted to see that fox again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure if he's still alive that\NOnimaru has given up on me by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 13 years after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have felt betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to that\Nmonk you were fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I saw, he went through this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But then he vanished into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, through that door you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.76,0:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you know something I don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.76,0:18:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This house is where we lived back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The sword stash was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...Kalik. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,None other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so pleased you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.26,0:18:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we both have\Nmany stories to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.74,0:18:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But allow me to settle a\Nmore pressing matter first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're aware that we've\Nconquered Udon, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I do not know all the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard that Sir Luffy's\Nextraordinary efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,won us a great many new recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you must be worried that\Nyou don't have enough swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We are still plotting, but\Nthere is no easy answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.18,0:19:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That wretched Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,By robbing his country of its weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he has stopped our plans\Ndead in their tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the predicament, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You may gather thousands\Nof soldiers without fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I will provide as many\Nweapons as you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.56,0:19:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a team and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make preparations to depart now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How odd. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru couldn't have done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It would require a\Nhuman's hand, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kawamatsu, I have fulfilled my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a week remains\Nbefore the day of the fire
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,festival when the samurai\Nwill launch their raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,On onigashima, fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.78,0:20:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro and company have just acquired\Na wealth of weapons for the.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,impending battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.89,0:20:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro Judo, that sword he took, if it\Ntruly is Shusui, you should return it to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll give you a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.65,0:20:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a sword that was handed down to me\Nfrom my late father, the famed blade Enma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that? It's a legendary sword.\NThe only one that's ever injured Kite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hyori, no, you cannot give\Naway a memento from Lord Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you may not know the tales but my father
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,was a skilled swordsman\Nin a two-sword style
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,wielding dual full-size blades when the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,end was near the very\Nday before his execution
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,he entrusted his blades\Nto his children and
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,since he wielded dual swords in battle one
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,was given to momonosuke\Nand one was given to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, my brother's. My
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,sword is Ame no Habekiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And my sword is Enma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, they were both forged by\Ngreat swordsmiths who were once famous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.56,0:21:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You could not hope for a finer sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They are too fine! Can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This fellow may be strong, but\Nhe's clearly quite dubious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't entrust him\Nwith Lord Odin's sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you feel strongly\Nabout this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But please do not disrespect\Nthe man who saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shusui belonged to Ryuma, who is\Nknown as the God of the Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.54,0:22:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot fathom how it\Nfell into your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess Moria\Ndid steal it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.85,0:22:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Juana wept when that sword was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than a blade to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.87,0:22:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please allow Shusui to be\Nreturned to its rightful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you can give\Nme a replacement, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I shared a battle with Ryuma's\Ncorpse, so I sort of feel a bond with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.56,0:23:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you Shusui back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll take Yenma.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I also want to pay a\Nvisit to Ryuma's gravesite?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.34,0:23:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You call this man trustworthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems rather delusional to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.70,0:23:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.70,0:23:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai arrested for rebelling against\Nthe shogun orgy have yet to be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:23:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasui boldly sacrificed his\Nlife in hopes of deceiving the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,enemy and salvaging the samurai's\Nplan that orgy had uncovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.56,0:24:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we settled this crap already.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.22,0:24:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We had nothing to do with those flyers!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.48,0:24:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They were a prank by Lord Yasui!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.64,0:24:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon tattoo was just a popular design!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.46,0:24:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're all rebels?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.18,0:24:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the Shogun so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a disgrace to be put\Non public display like
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.48,0:24:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,this as if we're some\Nsort of heinous criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.34,0:24:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you ashamed of yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.16,0:24:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.90,0:24:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you have to gain\Nfrom keeping us in here? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.38,0:24:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.78,0:24:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What else can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.90,0:24:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were supposed to have\Nan alliance with Kate and Apoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.96,0:24:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Must not have worked out too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.38,0:24:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you were already licking\NKaido's boots by the time I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.74,0:25:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, we were set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.06,0:25:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Scratchman Apu stabbed us in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.06,0:25:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, he was working\Nfor Kaido all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.48,0:25:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster Kaido stared\Nme in the eye and said.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.76,0:25:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to become my\Nsubordinate, I'll welcome you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.58,0:25:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always looking for strong warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.20,0:25:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to make the most\Npowerful army in the world after.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.80,0:25:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All my chances of victory in that\Ndire situation were zero percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.00,0:25:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My chances of successful\Nescape were zero percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.20,0:25:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My chances of survival\Nupon surrender were 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.08,0:25:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have much of a
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.32,0:25:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.23,0:25:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I but kid and killer\Nlacked my judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.96,0:26:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They challenged Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.68,0:26:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They fought and fought until they could\Nno longer so much as lift a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.78,0:26:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido won't kill men like\Nthat because he desires
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.42,0:26:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,their strength rather\Nhe'll attempt to crush
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.12,0:26:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,their spirits until they\Nbecome obedient but I
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.08,0:26:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,doubt that kid will ever\Nsubmit and so he'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite the pity for\Nhis crew, especially.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.12,0:26:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,orochi orders them to obey his whims vile
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.66,0:26:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'm sure and if they don't oblige\Nthey're told their captain will be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.62,0:26:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.74,0:26:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,four emperors truly are a
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,different breed than the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.06,0:26:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't trifle with reason like we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.38,0:26:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of unreasonable, how\Nis your alliance with Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.58,0:27:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,staying by his side has brought\Nyou all the way to wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.66,0:27:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you still\Nconfident in that choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.14,0:27:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking the questions here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.28,0:27:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever your plot is, as long as it allows\Nme to escape, I'm not gonna complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.62,0:27:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Six days remain until\Nthe raid on Onigashima.
